(373,783,'A disease caused by any of a number of species of protozoa in the genus LEISHMANIA. There are four major clinical types of this infection: cutaneous (Old and New World) (LEISHMANIASIS, CUTANEOUS), diffuse cutaneous (LEISHMANIASIS, DIFFUSE CUTANEOUS), mucocutaneous (LEISHMANIASIS, MUCOCUTANEOUS), and visceral (LEISHMANIASIS, VISCERAL).','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:40:01',NULL,NULL,'4713FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
