(1090,2338,'A carcinoma derived from stratified squamous epithelium. It may also occur in sites where glandular or columnar epithelium is normally present. (From Stedman, 25th ed)','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:40:34',NULL,NULL,'7753FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1091,2339,'A prolonged seizure or seizures repeated frequently enough to prevent recovery between episodes occurring over a period of 20-30 minutes. The most common subtype is generalized tonic-clonic status epilepticus, a potentially fatal condition associated with neuronal injury and respiratory and metabolic dysfunction. Nonconvulsive forms include petit mal status and complex partial status, which may manifest as behavioral disturbances. Simple partial status epilepticus consists of persistent motor, sensory, or autonomic seizures that do not impair cognition (see also EPILEPSIA PARTIALIS CONTINUA). Subclinical status epilepticus generally refers to seizures occurring in an unresponsive or comatose individual in the absence of overt signs of seizure activity. (From N Engl J Med 1998 Apr 2;338(14):970-6; Neurologia 1997 Dec;12 Suppl 6:25-30)','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:40:34',NULL,NULL,'7738FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1092,2340,'This is a neurological disorder associated with HIV infection and AIDS.','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:40:34',NULL,NULL,'16843FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1093,2344,'Motor behavior that is repetitive, often seemingly driven, and nonfunctional. This behavior markedly interferes with normal activities or results in severe bodily self-injury. The behavior is not due to the direct physiological effects of a substance or a general medical condition. (DSM-IV, 1994)','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:40:34',NULL,NULL,'7723FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1094,2345,'A variant of bullous erythema multiforme. It ranges from mild skin and mucous membrane lesions to a severe, sometimes fatal systemic disorder. Ocular symptoms include ulcerative conjunctivitis, keratitis, iritis, uveitis, and sometimes blindness. The cause of the disease is unknown.','en',2,'2026-10-08 22:40:34',NULL,NULL,'7720FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
